# [SYNTHETIC — FICTIONAL STUDY] Transcriptional response of a fictional cell line to a fictional compound

**Author:** GenomicsChain Synthetic Subject Generator

**Status of this document:** synthetic. The cell line, the compound, the reference, the
genes and the sequencing reads described here do not exist outside this document and its
supplement. The document was generated so that reproducibility checks can be run against a
study whose correct answer is known in advance. It is not a paper and has not been, and will
